    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n61834" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λαμπέτ-ης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ου</span>, ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>the
				lustrous one</i>, coined to expl. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λαμπετόωντι</span>, Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				1.104
			</span></i>:— fem. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λαμπέτις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ιδος</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Trag.</u>
				103
			</span></i>: also pr. n. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Λαμπετίη</span></b> , a daughter of Helios, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				12.132
			</span></i>; as epith. of Selene, <i><span class="en">
				Orph.
				<u>H.</u>
				9.9
			</span></i>.</div>
